IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `htta-donation`

-- Human Tissue and Transplant Act 1982 (WA), ss 3(1), 8, 9, 11-20, 22, 23, 24, 24A, 29, 29A, 34 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_human-tissue-and-transplant-act-1982_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Life facts are from the workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-{chloe,jake,daniel}/facts.json: chloe c026
-- (2021-03-20) and daniel d021 (2014-04-09) register as organ donors at 18; jake k097 (2079-04-18) dies at 72, on the
-- Register since 2047, kidneys donated, survived by his daughter Ruby (46), his sister Chloe (76) and his former wife
-- Tahlia (72; married 2033 to 2039) -- his parents Graham and Sue died in 2052 and 2060; daniel d092 (2078-10-21) dies
-- at 82, on the Register, survived by his wife Priya (81), their children Anjali (51) and Luca (48) and his sister Sofia
-- (79) -- his parents died in 2052 and 2069. Being on the Register is entered as the deceased's expressed wish or consent
-- under s 22(2)(a): AN INFERENCE, the Act does not mention the Register. That Jake was ventilated, and who declared
-- brain death, are ASSUMPTIONS: the life does not say. The other cases vary one fact at a time.

